OL,3,AFour civilians killed in Pakistani
OL,4,Astrikes in Afghanistan, Taliban says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfghanistan's Taliban government said a
OL,7,Fwave of Pakistani air strikes had
OL,8,Fkilled four civilians in the latest
OL,9,Fescalation between the two sides.
OL,11,FThe strikes hit provinces including
OL,12,FKandahar, the Taliban's base of power,
OL,13,Fsources told the BBC. A resident told
OL,14,FAFP news agency they heard a jet,
OL,15,Ffollowed by a large explosion and then
OL,16,Fa fire in the city.
OL,18,FPakistan said its forces had struck 10
OL,19,Ftargets in Afghanistan, without
OL,20,Fspecifying their locations, adding the
OL,21,Fstrikes were "strictly limited to
OL,22,Fidentified military objectives".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
